      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Conclusion</h3>On this page, we learned how to make bigger numbers. But we only showed numbers that can be linked to our fingers. These numbers have names without a clear pattern. On the next pages, we will learn about the connection between numbers and our families.</p>",
